{"cantica":"paradiso","cantoNumber":28,"title":"Canto XXVIII","totalDuration":360.64,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"After the truth about the present life\nof wretched mortals was revealed\nby her who fills my mind with paradise,","startTime":0,"endTime":6.96,"words":[{"word":"After","start":0.081,"end":0.481},{"word":"the","start":0.481,"end":0.721},{"word":"truth","start":0.721,"end":0.961},{"word":"about","start":0.961,"end":1.281},{"word":"the","start":1.281,"end":1.521},{"word":"present","start":1.521,"end":1.761},{"word":"life","start":1.761,"end":2.081},{"word":"of","start":2.081,"end":2.321},{"word":"wretched","start":2.321,"end":2.721},{"word":"mortals","start":2.721,"end":3.281},{"word":"was","start":3.281,"end":3.561},{"word":"revealed","start":3.561,"end":4.041},{"word":"by","start":4.041,"end":4.241},{"word":"her","start":4.241,"end":4.681},{"word":"who","start":4.681,"end":4.881},{"word":"fills","start":4.881,"end":5.281},{"word":"my","start":5.281,"end":5.521},{"word":"mind","start":5.521,"end":5.961},{"word":"with","start":5.961,"end":6.161},{"word":"paradise,","start":6.161,"end":6.96}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Like someone who sees a candle's flame reflected in a mirror,\nlit from behind before they turn to look directly at the source,\nthen spins around to check if the glass tells the truth,\nfinding perfect harmony between reflection and reality\nlike music matching its own rhythm—\nso I remember doing as I gazed into those beautiful eyes\nthat Love had made into snares to capture me.\nAnd when I turned, my own eyes touched\nby what appears in that revolving sphere\nwhenever we focus our intent gaze upon it,\nI saw a point radiating light so sharp and piercing\nthat any sight it kindles must close tight\nagainst such overwhelming brilliance.\nWhatever star appears smallest from earth\nwould seem a moon if placed beside this point,\nas close as one star sits next to another.\nPerhaps at the distance where a halo appears\nto circle the light that paints it\nwhen the mist holding it grows thickest—\nat such a distance around the point, a ring of fire\nspun so swiftly it would have outpaced\nwhatever motion fastest girds our world.\nThis ring was circled by another,\nthat by a third, the third by a fourth,\nthe fourth by a fifth, then a sixth around the fifth.\nThe seventh spread so wide in its circumference\nthat Juno's rainbow messenger entire\nwould be too narrow to contain it.\nSo too the eighth and ninth, and each one\nmoved more slowly as its number placed it\nfarther distant from the first.\nThe ring whose flame burned most crystal-clear\nwas closest to that stainless spark,\nbecause, I think, it drinks most deeply of its truth.\nMy Lady, seeing me bewildered and perplexed,\nsaid: \"From that point depends\nall heaven and all nature.\nLook at the circle joined most close to it—\nknow that its motion burns so swift\nbecause of the blazing love that spurs it on.\"","startTime":6.96,"endTime":119.2,"words":[{"word":"Like","start":7.041,"end":7.281},{"word":"someone","start":7.281,"end":7.681},{"word":"who","start":7.681,"end":7.881},{"word":"sees","start":7.881,"end":8.081},{"word":"a","start":8.081,"end":8.241},{"word":"candle's","start":8.241,"end":8.801},{"word":"flame","start":8.801,"end":9.321},{"word":"reflected","start":9.321,"end":9.801},{"word":"in","start":9.801,"end":9.921},{"word":"a","start":9.921,"end":10.161},{"word":"mirror,","start":10.161,"end":10.961},{"word":"lit","start":10.961,"end":11.201},{"word":"from","start":11.201,"end":11.361},{"word":"behind","start":11.361,"end":11.921},{"word":"before","start":11.921,"end":12.241},{"word":"they","start":12.241,"end":12.401},{"word":"turn","start":12.401,"end":12.641},{"word":"to","start":12.641,"end":12.801},{"word":"look","start":12.801,"end":12.961},{"word":"directly","start":12.961,"end":13.441},{"word":"at","start":13.441,"end":13.601},{"word":"the","start":13.601,"end":13.881},{"word":"source,","start":13.8