44},{"word":"you'll","start":199.44,"end":199.76},{"word":"see","start":199.76,"end":200.08},{"word":"a","start":200.08,"end":200.4},{"word":"marvelous","start":200.4,"end":201.04},{"word":"correspondence—","start":201.04,"end":202.68},{"word":"greater","start":202.68,"end":202.96},{"word":"to","start":202.96,"end":203.12},{"word":"more,","start":203.12,"end":203.84},{"word":"and","start":203.84,"end":204},{"word":"smaller","start":204,"end":204.56},{"word":"to","start":204.56,"end":204.8},{"word":"less—","start":204.8,"end":205.6},{"word":"in","start":205.6,"end":205.92},{"word":"every","start":205.92,"end":206.4},{"word":"heaven","start":206.4,"end":206.96},{"word":"with","start":206.96,"end":207.24},{"word":"its","start":207.24,"end":207.44},{"word":"guiding","start":207.44,"end":207.92},{"word":"Intelligence.","start":207.92,"end":209.04}]},{"id":7,"speaker":"narrator","text":"Just as the hemisphere of air remains\nsplendid and serene when the north wind\nblows from his gentler side,\npurified and clearing away the haze\nthat once disturbed it, until the sky laughs\nwith all the beauties of its pageantry—\nso I became, once my Lady\nprovided me her luminous answer,\nand like a star in heaven, the truth appeared.\nAs soon as her words came to a stop,\nthose circles blazed and sparkled\nexactly like molten iron when it's stirred.\nEach spark repeated their coruscation,\nand they were so many that their number\nmakes more millions than the doubling of the chessboard.\nI heard them singing \"Hosanna\" choir by choir\nto the fixed point that holds them in their place\nand always will, where they have always been.\nAnd she who saw the doubtful meditations\nwithin my mind said: \"The first circles\nhave shown you Seraphim and Cherubim.\nThey follow their bonds with such speed\nto become as much like the point as possible,\nand they can, as far as they soar high in vision.\nThose other Loves that wheel around them\nare called Thrones of the divine countenance,\ncompleting the first Triad.\nYou should know they all find their delight\nexactly as far as their vision penetrates\nthe Truth in which all understanding rests.\nFrom this you see how blessedness\nis founded in the power that sees,\nnot in the power that loves and follows after.\nMerit measures this seeing,\nborn from grace joined with good will—\nand so it proceeds from grade to grade.\nThe second Triad, blossoming\nin this eternal spring\nthat no winter night can strip of leaves,\nsings \"Hosanna\" perpetually\nwith threefold melody sounding through three\nOrders of joy that braid together.\nIn this hierarchy dwell three Divine orders:\nfirst Dominions, then Virtues,\nand third comes the order of Powers.\nIn the final two dancing rings\nPrincipalities and Archangels wheel,\nthe last made wholly of Angels at play.\nAll these orders gaze upward,\nand prevail downward with such force\nthat all draw toward God and all attract.\nDionysius set himself with such great longing\nto contemplate these Orders\nthat he named and ranked them as I do.\nBut Gregory later disagreed with him,\nso when he opened his eyes\nwithin this heaven, he smiled at himself.\nAnd if a mortal revealed so much\nsecret truth on earth, don't be amazed—\nthe one who saw it here disclosed it to him,\nalong with much more truth about these circles.\"","startTime":209.04,"endTime":360.64,"words":[{"word":"Just","start":209.2,"end":209.52},{"word":"as","start":209.52,"end":209.68},{"word":"the","start":209.68,"end":209.84},{"word":"hemisphere","start":209.84,"end":210.4},{"word":"of","start":210.4,"end":210.56},{"word":"air","start":210.56,"end":210.88},{"word":"remains","start":210.88,"end":211.4},{"word":"splendid","start":211.4,"end":212},{"word":"and","start":212,"end":212.16},{"word":"serene","start":212.16,"end":212.8},{"word":"when","start":212.8,"end":212.92},{"word":"the","start":212.92,"end":213.04},{"word":"north","start":213.04,"end":213.36},{"word":"wind","start":213.36,"end":213.64},{"word":"blows